pan>Is ThePhotoStick® Omni X easy to use?</span></button><div data-pf-expandable="true" data-id="1b4f27ee-37be-470f-a7b6-62dd107dd7d7" style="display:none" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-ecPDsT cXkryg pf-894_"><p class="sc-lfYA-dV cHEUzQ pf-895_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-cHMHbD bwTmDt pf-897_">Yes, getting started with ThePhotoStick Omni X is incredibly easy! Please note, however, that it will take some time for ThePhotoStick Omni X to find each of your photos and safely back them up. This time can vary depending on how many photos you have, the size of your files, and the type of device you are using. But the great thing about ThePhotoStick Omni X is that anyone can use it, no matter how comfortable they are with technology!<br><br>Check out our <b><a href="https://www.manula.com/manuals/product-support/thephotostick-omni-official-user-guide/" target="_blank"><u>User Guide</u></a></b> for more information on getting started with ThePhotoStick&nbsp;Omni X. We also offer 24/7 support if you have any questions or difficulties: support@thephotostick.com</span></p></div></div><div data-pf-type="Accordion.Content.Wrapper" class="sc-kzqdYt kOLxBk pf-898_"><button type="button" class="sc-kWtorq hATpgU pf-899_ pf-bg-lazy pf-anchor" data-header-id="a4946f30-0ccb-4e9f-a83b-918622cc27f5" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="pfa pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow"></i><span>Which devices are compatible with ThePhotostick® Omni X?</span></button><div data-pf-expandable="true" data-id="a4946f30-0ccb-4e9f-a83b-918622cc27f5" style="display:none" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-ecPDsT cXkryg pf-901_"><p class="sc-lfYA-dV cHEUzQ pf-902_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-cHMHbD bwTmDt pf-904_">Almost all major Android, iPhone, and iPad devices!<br><br>It's compatible with Windows, Android, and Mac Operating Systems:<br>- Windows: Windows 7 SP1 and later<br>- macOS: macOS X 10.13 and later<br>- Apple: iOS and iPadOS 13.0 and later<br>- Android: 8.0 and later<br><br>For more up to date information regarding ThePhotoStick compatibility, we recommend viewing our <a href="/pages/support-system-requirements" target="_self"><u><strong>System Requirements</strong></u></a> page.&nbsp;</span></p></div></div><div data-pf-type="Accordion.Content.Wrapper" class="sc-kzqdYt kOLxBk pf-905_"><button type="button" class="sc-kWtorq hATpgU pf-906_ pf-bg-lazy pf-anchor" data-header-id="1b0f4bd3-3fc8-4a2b-9ef5-f33cd75d5ffa" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="pfa pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow"></i><span>How many photos can I store on ThePhotoStick® Omni X?</span></button><div data-pf-expandable="true" data-id="1b0f4bd3-3fc8-4a2b-9ef5-f33cd75d5ffa" style="display:none" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-ecPDsT cXkryg pf-908_"><p class="sc-lfYA-dV cHEUzQ pf-909_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-cHMHbD bwTmDt pf-911_">Approximate Number of Photos Stored on ThePhotoStick Omni X:<br><br>16GB - 6,400 photos<br>32 GB - 12,800 photos<br>64 GB - 25,600 photos<br>128 GB - 51,200 photos<br>256 GB - 102,400 photos<br><br>*Please note that storage capacity per GB listed above is approximate, and exact storage amounts vary depending on file type and size.</span></p></div></div><div data-pf-type="Accordion.Content.Wrapper" class="sc-kzqdYt kOLxBk pf-912_"><button type="button" class="sc-kWtorq hATpgU pf-913_ pf-bg-lazy pf-anchor" data-header-id="8ea52773-03a6-4cc0-a5fa-4666380593c4" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="pfa pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow"></i><span>What photo and video files types can ThePhotoStick® Omni X find and save?</span></button><div data-pf-expandable="true" data-id="8ea52773-03a6-4cc0-a5fa-4666380593c4" style="display:none" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-ecPDsT cXkryg pf-915_"><p class="sc-lfYA-dV cHEUzQ pf-916_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-cHMHbD bwTmDt pf-918_">Nearly all of them! It saves your standard JPEG, HEIC, PNG, GIF, MOV, and MPEG4, but it also saves a vast array of file types as listed below:<br><br><b>PHOTO EXTENSIONS:<br></b>- JPEG (*.jpg;*.jpeg;*.jpe;*.jfif)<br>- HEIC (*.heic, *.heics, *.heif, *.heifs, *.avci, *.avcs)<br>- GIF (*.gif)
- PNG (*.png)<br>- BMP (*.bmp;*.rle;*.dib)<br>- TIFF (*.tif,*.tiff)<br>- ICO (*.ico)<br>- Camera Raw (*.crw, *.nef, *.raf, *.orf, *.mrw, *.dcr, *.mos, *.raw, *.pef, *.srf, *.dng, *.x3f, *.cr2, *.erf, *.sr2, *.kdc, *.mfw, *.mef, *.arw, *.nrw, *.rw2, *.rwl, *.iiq, *.3fr, *.srw)<br>- Photoshop (*.psd, *.pdd, *.pdp, *.pse, *.eps)<br>- PICT File (*.PCT, *.PICT)<br><br><b>VIDEO EXTENSIONS:</b><br>- MOV (*.mov, *.qt, *.hevc)<br>- MPEG4 (*.mp4, *.mpeg4, *.m4v, *.h264)<br>- AVI (*.avi)<br>- WMV (*.wmv)<br><br>OTHER EXTENSIONS:<br>- DOC (*.doc, *.word)<br>- PDF (*.pdf)<br>- Contacts (*.vcf, *.contact)</span></p></div></div><div data-pf-type="Accordion.Content.Wrapper" class="sc-kzqdYt kOLxBk pf-919_"><button type="button" class="sc-kWtorq hATpgU pf-920_ pf-bg-lazy pf-anchor" data-header-id="8789fce5-5d4b-4df1-a968-37ea0d469a6b" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="pfa pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow"></i><span>Can I use ThePhotoStick® Omni X as an ongoing backup solution?</span></button><div data-pf-expandable="true" data-id="8789fce5-5d4b-4df1-a968-37ea0d469a6b" style="display:none" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-ecPDsT cXkryg pf-922_"><p class="sc-lfYA-dV cHEUzQ pf-923_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-cHMHbD bwTmDt pf-925_">Yes, it’s a great backup solution! Many people plug ThePhotoStick Omni X in each night for a quick and easy backup to make sure they are continually protecting their memories.

</span></p></div></div><div data-pf-type="Accordion.Content.Wrapper" class="sc-kzqdYt kOLxBk pf-926_"><button type="button" class="sc-kWtorq hATpgU pf-927_ pf-bg-lazy pf-anchor" data-header-id="7ed99b7a-2ad6-460c-bd45-c3872c4692f7" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="pfa pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow"></i><span>Does ThePhotoStick® Omni X come with tech support?</span></button><div data-pf-expandable="true" data-id="7ed99b7a-2ad6-460c-bd45-c3872c4692f7" style="display:none" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-ecPDsT cXkryg pf-929_"><p class="sc-lfYA-dV cHEUzQ pf-930_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-cHMHbD bwTmDt pf-932_">Of course! Visit our website, www.thephotostick.com, and click the gray circle near the bottom right corner of the page to begin chatting with a member of our Support Team.<br><br>Live Chat available Monday-Saturday, 8am-8pm PST</span></p></div></div><div data-pf-type="Accordion.Content.Wrapper" class="sc-kzqdYt kOLxBk pf-933_"><button type="button" class="sc-kWtorq hATpgU pf-934_ pf-bg-lazy pf-anchor" data-header-id="30c60cdd-6498-4d27-8fc5-1444674866bf" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="pfa pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow"></i><span>How does the 30 Day Money Back Guarantee work?</span></button><div data-pf-expandable="true" data-id="30c60cdd-6498-4d27-8fc5-1444674866bf" style="display:none" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-ecPDsT cXkryg pf-936_"><p class="sc-lfYA-dV cHEUzQ pf-937_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-cHMHbD bwTmDt pf-939_">We offer a no-hassle, 30-Day Money Back Guarantee. If you’re not 100% satisfied with your purchase from ThePhotoStick®, we are here to help you with a return. We want you to be happy!<br><br>If you are not completely satisfied with your order, please contact us at returns@thephotostick.com and we'd be happy to facilitate your return and refund.</span></p></div></div><div data